### GM Radio Button Behavior

The UI has a radio button toggle labeled "GM" (Gemini Mode). When ON, ALL renders go through Gemini regardless of scene type or quality tier. This gives the user a fast 1-3 second preview at $0.045/image using the existing `api/gemini.ts` endpoint. No changes to the current Gemini flow are needed.

When GM is OFF, renders go through the FLUX multi-pass pipel
```

**Pass 2** → `flux-depth-pro` — takes Pass 1 result, extracts depth, re-renders with better materials and lighting while preserving spatial structure

